ub.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114555#issuecomment-3727259460","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114555","id":3727259460,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eKXdE","user":{"login":"onequid","id":49135017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MTM1MDE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49135017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid","html_url":"https://github.com/onequid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-09T05:29:21Z","updated_at":"2026-01-09T05:29:21Z","body":"Thank you very much for the test .\nI don't think the change would make such a difference in performance. As to linux, the only change would be replacing \"==\" with the `is_equivalent()` function. \n\nDid it freeze generally or just when assets were added?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3727259460/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3728936302","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114555#issuecomment-3728936302","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114555","id":3728936302,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eQw1u","user":{"login":"onequid","id":49135017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MTM1MDE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49135017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid","html_url":"https://github.com/onequid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-09T13:34:25Z","updated_at":"2026-01-09T13:34:25Z","body":"After a second thought I'd rather not change the `==` with `is_equivalent` in `DirAccess::copy()`:\r\n1. it works fine before and this PR was itended to standardize the path variables passing to it.\r\n2. The reason is unknonwn why there are only `DirAccessUnix::copy` and `DirAccessWindows::copy`. Were overrides for other platforms interupted for some reason, or the `==` check was determined to be sufficient already? And the `DirAccess::copy` is just `==` itself.\r\n3. In a long run, it's much more complex to maintain the codes even if all the overrides for platforms were completed.\r\n\r\nAnd thanks a lot for all the help and advice here.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3728936302/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3731265902","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114555#issuecomment-3731265902","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114555","id":3731265902,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eZplu","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-10T01:18:01Z","updated_at":"2026-01-10T01:18:01Z","body":"> Did it freeze generally or just when assets were added?\r\n\r\nGenerally, caused my computer to also crash. But, the logic seems fine to me.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3731265902/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3788486467","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114555#issuecomment-3788486467","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114555","id":3788486467,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hz7dD","user":{"login":"onequid","id":49135017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MTM1MDE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49135017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid","html_url":"https://github.com/onequid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/onequid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-23T06:12:14Z","updated_at":"2026-01-23T06:14:55Z","body":"Adding a .png file from a web browser by drag-and-drop works on MacOS, as I was told. But it didn't work on Windows yet. \r\nBased on the changes here, I tried to implement it.\r\n\r\nFirstly with `HTTPRequest` (see \"scene/main/http_request.cpp\"), and `HTTPRequest` is only permitted to be used in a `tree`.\r\nThen with the `WinHttp` api, this might be the last way to implement it. As we have HTTP implemented in `core/io` and related to \"Asset Libary\", so the new codes would not be reused anywhere else.\r\n\r\nBefore more efforts, whether this feature (drag-n-drop from a browser) is wanted or not? \r\nWe have the \"Asset Library\" already, the feature may not be used often, but personally it is still cool to just drag the assets from a web browser, and maybe further it can be integrated with the \"Asset Library\" so that even extensions can be installed via drag. (Should a proposal be opened?)\r\n\r\nIf it is wanted, should it create a download task like those are downloaded from \"Asset Library\", which it probably does not on MacOS/Unix now(need comfirm)? ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3788486467/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]